d-atlas/wisconsin/oneida-county"],["ARC or PLC in Oneida County","/arc-plc/wisconsin/oneida-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs 75 years, from 1951 to 2025, and January to February came in under 90% of normal in 39 of them, the most of any pair. In 2025, on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 12 grids, October to November came in at 50% of normal and February to March at 189%. Grid 31060 had its driest year in 1976 at 64% of normal. On grid 30763 the preliminary estimate for July to August 2026 is 46.7, and that is NOAA rain, not RMA&rsquo;s final index.</p>"}
